---
title: INCIDENT TRIAGE  ·  first response
---
flowchart TD
    accDescr: When in doubt, escalate.
    alert([Alert fires]) --> ack["Acknowledge<br>post in #incident"]
    ack --> impact{"Users affected?"}
    impact -->|no| ticket[["Open a ticket<br>*handle next business day*"]]
    impact -->|yes| deploy{"Deploy in the last hour?"}
    deploy -->|yes| rollback["Roll back<br>✓ restore previous version"]
    deploy -->|no| infra{"Infrastructure issue?"}
    infra -->|yes| sre["Escalate to SRE<br>**page the on-call**"]
    infra -->|no| owner["Contact the owning team"]
    rollback & sre & owner --> status["Update the status page"]
    status --> postmortem([Postmortem])

    classDef danger stroke:#f08080
    class sre danger
